  "releaseNotes": "Updated the package description and publication documentation. Reorganized the README with current installation instructions, API coverage, runtime requirements and usage guidance. Retained geometry and load APIs, including GetLoadCases, together with model lifecycle, window control and typed analysis operations. Included XML IntelliSense and shipped API guides. The runtime API is unchanged from 1.0.0-preview.20261014.6. Validated the existing 914-test implementation and 149 installed-package XML example blocks; native compatibility validation remains in progress. Full release notes: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
